			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741410101,
					"content": "（書頁上的內容依舊是由無法理解的圖形、字母、古語，以及幾何圖形構成，但集中精神後似乎能漸漸理解其中的內容了。）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "閱讀"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410102,
					"content": "夏諾蒂拉好像不在耶！可能又到那個神秘的地方去了！要進行「冥想」嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410103,
					"content": "聽了她上次說的話…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410104,
					"content": "有點在意，我要去看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410105,
					"content": "唔…雖然有點不安，不過我們一起去吧！夏諾蒂拉真是讓人擔心呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410106,
					"content": "派蒙，妳在外面等我就好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410107,
					"content": "欸？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410108,
					"content": "「揭示之書」的世界…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410109,
						741410110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410109,
					"content": "可能比想像中更危險。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410111,
					"content": "所以…我不希望妳冒險。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410112,
					"content": "但是…但是我們一直以來不是都一起冒險嗎？只要我們在一起就沒有克服不了的困難、戰勝不了的敵人才對…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410113,
					"content": "裡面的危險可能不是戰鬥就能夠解決的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410114,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410115,
					"content": "#好吧！哼，{F#妳}{M#你}比我聰明多了，我相信{F#妳}{M#你}。那{F#妳}{M#你}可不要拋下我喔！我會一直等{F#妳}{M#你}回來的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410110,
					"content": "可能有我們不知道的一面。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410111
					]
				}
			]
		},
