					"content": "卡特皮拉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410803
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410803,
					"content": "誰？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410804,
					"content": "#原來是{F#妳}{M#你}啊…我記得{F#妳}{M#你}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410805,
					"content": "你怎麼會在這裡？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410806
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410806,
					"content": "#被{F#妳}{M#你}搶先了。我也想問{F#妳}{M#你}這個問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410807,
					"content": "沒什麼，我只是覺得…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410808,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}是{NICKNAME}，對吧？{F#妳}{M#你}身邊那個白色的小東西…叫什麼名字？她怎麼沒有和{F#妳}{M#你}一起？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410809,
						741410811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410809,
					"content": "派蒙在外面等我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410810,
					"content": "#是叫這個名字嗎？算了，無所謂。{F#妳}{M#你}是好人，派蒙也是好人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410812,
					"content": "#我來這裡是要找一個很重要的東西，{F#妳}{M#你}知道我要找的是什麼嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410813,
					"content": "#算了，就當我沒問吧。{F#妳}{M#你}怎麼會在這裡？快點離開，這裡很危險。以前有人來這裡接受試煉，結果迷失了，腦子變成了漿糊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410814,
					"content": "#我想起來了，我和{F#妳}{M#你}，我們曾經做過很厲害的事情。那是我一生中唯一值得驕傲的事情…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410815,
					"content": "你是說…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410816,
						741410818
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410816,
					"content": "戰勝納齊森科魯茲？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410817
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410817,
					"content": "#大師他怎麼了？{F#妳}{M#你}也是水仙十字結社的成員嗎…還是說，{F#妳}{M#你}是吉約丹的人？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410820,
					"content": "啊，金色的蝴蝶，像陽光一樣耀眼的顏色。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410821,
					"content": "只要得到了那樣的光，一切都會…一切都會…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410818,
					"content": "拯救莉諾爾？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410819
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741410819,
					"content": "我想起來了。沒錯，我們帶著莉諾爾逃出了海底的牢獄。孩子們不應該生活在那樣的地方，她應該生活在陽光下、花叢中。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 741410811,
					"content": "你還好嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741410812
					]
				}
			]
		},
