					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741411106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741411106,
					"content": "沒什麼，這裡面真的很危險。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741411107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741411107,
					"content": "是喔…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741411108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741411108,
					"content": "這麼說來，夏諾蒂拉怎麼還沒回來呀？該不會到楓丹廷裡當警衛去了吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741411109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741411109,
					"content": "下次再來吧…我頭有點暈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741411110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741411110,
					"content": "#是喔…那一起去找點東西吃吧？{F#妳}{M#你}害我擔心得都餓了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741411111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 741411111,
					"content": "不是才過了一眨眼的時間？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741411112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 741411112,
					"content": "#我可是很用力、很用力地擔心{F#妳}{M#你}！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
